        ["I've bought enough animals for today!"] = "¡He comprado suficientes animales para hoy!",
        ["Are you sure you want me to take all the Rabbits you're holding? I won't take any of your favourites."] = "¿Estás seguro de que quieres que me lleve todos los conejos que tienes? No aceptaré ninguno de tus favoritos.",
